Keep a shared values as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared lefts as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared rights as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared queue as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared emptyseen as 0.
Keep a shared complete as 0.
Place 1 into values.
Place 2 into values.
Place 3 into values.
Place 4 into values.
Place 5 into values.
Place 6 into values.
Place 1 into lefts.
Place 3 into lefts.
Place 5 into lefts.
Place -1 into lefts.
Place -1 into lefts.
Place -1 into lefts.
Place 2 into rights.
Place 4 into rights.
Place -1 into rights.
Place -1 into rights.
Place -1 into rights.
Place -1 into rights.
Set complete to 1.

The last is the last position of values.
The head is 0, while the count is 1.
Place 0 into queue.
Repeat while head is less than count and complete is 1.
The node is item head of queue.
Add 1 to head.
If item node of values is less than 0, set emptyseen to 1.
If item node of values is at least 0.
If emptyseen is 1, set complete to 0.
If emptyseen is 0.
The leftindex is node times 2 plus 1.
The rightindex is node times 2 plus 2.
If leftindex is at most last, Place leftindex into queue, add 1 to count.
If rightindex is at most last, Place rightindex into queue, add 1 to count.

If complete is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
